[{"title":"竹 其七","author":"徐渭","text":"修蛇有尾频年坠，小凤为翎几日成。\n输与寒梢三十尺，春来秪用一雷惊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39520,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹 其八","author":"徐渭","text":"人家宿纸几时收，紫兔尖尖走泼油。\n竹影满窗凉似水，断厓疏雨数竿秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39521,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹 其十","author":"徐渭","text":"怪石初烘泼墨匀，吴笺短短缩霜筠。\n长空五尺青鸾尾，一半斜封在白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39522,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写竹与某","author":"徐渭","text":"桃叶渡头一见君，为言岸上石榴裙。\n相逢无钱可买醉，赠与竹枝撩白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39523,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"都门五月写送某君之官新昌","author":"徐渭","text":"君去新昌五月时，都门日近火云移。\n赠君数叶迎风物，并入高帆一道吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39524,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"勾勒竹","author":"徐渭","text":"自缘勾勒减松煤，非关白雪压枝低。\n梢似东坡碑上笔，路人才掘出深泥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39525,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画笋遗许口北","author":"徐渭","text":"口北清馋似大苏，穷边那得笋烧垆。\n曾闻止渴消梅子，故写龙孙与大夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39526,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画竹与吴镇 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"聚干垂梢凡几重，只须用墨一分浓。\n即令小节无些用，也自成林一壑中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39527,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画竹与吴镇 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"东坡画竹多荆棘，却惹评论受俗嗔。\n自是俗人浑不识，东坡特写两般人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39528,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"倒竹","author":"徐渭","text":"长笺白白墨焦焦，倒扫青蛇挂一梢。\n应有断厓藏半幅，苍藤翠藓倚天高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39529,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画竹","author":"徐渭","text":"东吴药绢白濛濛，况值胶矾盏内空。\n烂颖扫来孤凤影，江湘细雨淡烟中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39530,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旧作竹与某复要予再作答此","author":"徐渭","text":"此竹是予昔所作，即欲再作今不能。\n雀老既然成海蛤，转教为雀可飞腾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39531,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写倒竹答某饷","author":"徐渭","text":"胡麻绿菽两尖堆，回施无他写竹回。\n卷去忽开应怪叫，皂龙抽尾扫风雷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39532,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹石","author":"徐渭","text":"青蛇拔尾向何天，紫石如鹰啄兔拳。\n醉里偶成豪健景，老夫终岁懒成眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39533,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写竹拟送友人之官长沙","author":"徐渭","text":"无不长沙吊贾生，贾生也自吊灵均。\n头陀暗里争餐鲙，却把乾鱼哭向人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39534,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初春未雷而笋有穿篱者醉中狂扫大幅","author":"徐渭","text":"脑尾春头试爆馀，竹根惊笋两三株。\n却冯一匕硫黄末，竟夺雷州稳卧猪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39535,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写竹寿郁颖上","author":"徐渭","text":"颖上今年五十逢，野人为寿不堪供。\n生移数叶淇园绿，但愿君为卫武公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39536,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画笋竹贺许口北得子","author":"徐渭","text":"小叶潇潇翠羽疏，东攒西簇护龙雏。\n蜀笺何用长三丈，数寸班鳞见大都。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39537,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菊竹","author":"徐渭","text":"若不重阳贳一壶，那能了此菊花逋。\n竹梢墨色潮如此，试看明朝有雨无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39538,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荷 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"五月五日热太烘，疾挥纨扇不能攻。\n欲呼小艇耶溪去，荷叶荷花十里风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39539,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荷 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"一斗湖光不放宽，却于纸上定波澜。\n犀盘墨尽浑无蜜，捧出茅山女道冠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39540,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荷 其三","author":"徐渭","text":"一瓣真成盖一鸳，西风捲地仅能掀。\n花枝力大争狮子，丈六如来踏不翻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39541,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荷 其四","author":"徐渭","text":"荷叶五寸荷花娇，贴波不碍画船摇。\n想到熏风四五月，也能遮却美人腰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39542,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荷 其五","author":"徐渭","text":"子建相逢恐未真，寄言个是洛川神。\n东风枉与涂脂粉，睡老鸳鸯不嫁人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39543,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荷 其六","author":"徐渭","text":"花垂叶倒露难擎，颈折鹅飞咽不鸣。\n渐看湖光平似掌，秋来无处立蜻蜓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39544,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荷 其七","author":"徐渭","text":"五月莲舟苧浦头，长花大叶插中流。\n即令遮得西施面，遮得歌声度叶不。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39545,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画荷花送陈都挥往招宝","author":"徐渭","text":"招宝青天碧凤翔，沈香大士坐中央。\n知君一叶春涛外，遥指莲花出海洋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39546,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画荷寿某君","author":"徐渭","text":"若个荷花不有香，若条荷柄不堪觞。\n百年不饮将何为，况直双槽琥珀黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39547,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"翎菊","author":"徐渭","text":"研底毫端秋气清，攒花蔟蕊笔通灵。\n看来不似篱边色，拔取何天白鹤翎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39548,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画菊 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"身世浑如拍海舟，关门累月不梳头。\n东篱蝴蝶閒来往，看写黄花过一秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39549,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画菊 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"经旬不食似蚕眠，更有何心问岁年。\n忽报街头糕五色，西风重九菊花天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39550,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牡丹","author":"徐渭","text":"五十八年贫贱身，何曾妄念洛阳春。\n不然岂少胭脂在，富贵花将墨写神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39551,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪牡丹 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"银海笼春冷茜浓，松煤急貌不能红。\n太真月下胭脂颊，试问谁曾见影中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39552,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪牡丹 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"绛帻笼头五尺长，吹箫弄玉别成妆。\n不知何事妆如此，一道瑶天白凤凰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39553,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人有以旧抹牡丹索题者","author":"徐渭","text":"何年草草抹花王，此日将题岁月忘。\n拾得懒仙抛下蜕，不堪教赞旧皮囊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39554,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遮叶牡丹","author":"徐渭","text":"为君小写洛阳春，叶叶遮眉巧弄颦。\n终是倾城娇绝世，只须半面越撩人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39555,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梨花 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"名园深锁丽长空，映户摇扉一万丛。\n总使梅花开似雪，却输毬雪打和风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39556,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梨花 其三","author":"徐渭","text":"带烟笼雾自生香，薄粉浓铅不用妆。\n莫以轻盈窥宋玉，冯将淡白恼何郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39557,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梨花 其四","author":"徐渭","text":"春雨春风能几宵，吹香落粉湿还飘。\n朝来试看青枝上，几朵寒酥未肯消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39558,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梨花 其五","author":"徐渭","text":"早起春晴香雾肥，独依残月出墙围。\n洛滨仙子波心立，虢国夫人马上归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39559,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梨花 其六","author":"徐渭","text":"轻风吹雾散朱门，影落冯谁写素魂。\n万里晓天微有晕，终宵明月欲无痕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39560,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画梨花折枝","author":"徐渭","text":"粉晕微销墨一丝，春风春雨未来时。\n名园无此好颜色，知是宫中第几枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39561,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水仙 其一","author":"徐渭","text":"杜若青青江水连，鹧鸪拍拍下江烟。\n湘夫人正苍梧去，莫遣一声啼竹边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39562,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水仙 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"百品娇春俗却春，一清无可拟丰神。\n银钿缟袂田家妇，绝粒休粮女道人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39563,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水仙 其三","author":"徐渭","text":"略有风情陈妙常，绝无烟火杜兰香。\n昆吾锋尽终难似，愁杀苏州陆子刚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39564,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水仙 其四","author":"徐渭","text":"海庙元君断百荤，粉腮胭颊弃如焚。\n江心罗袜从渠踏，不乱长波皱绿纹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39565,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水仙 其五","author":"徐渭","text":"姊妹商量明月堤，夜妆莫解绿鬟丝。\n黄陵庙口无多路，去听女郎歌竹枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39566,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪水仙","author":"徐渭","text":"西子云軿趁雪行，白鸾无力海绡冰。\n玉京固是朝天路，如此清寒苦不胜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39567,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水仙兰","author":"徐渭","text":"自从生长到如今，烟火何曾著一分。\n湘水湘波接巫峡，肯从峰上作行云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39568,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"葡萄 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"数串明珠挂水清，醉来将墨写能成。\n当年何用相如壁，始换西秦十五城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39569,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"葡萄 其三","author":"徐渭","text":"自从初夏到今朝，百事无心总弃抛。\n尚有旧时书秃笔，偶将蘸墨黠葡萄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39570,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"葡萄 其四","author":"徐渭","text":"昨岁中秋月倍圆，海南母蚌太鼾眠。\n明珠一夜无人管，迸向谁家壁上县。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39571,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王生索写卜萄","author":"徐渭","text":"王生昔日好容颜，今日相逢范叔寒。\n赠与明珠三百颗，谁知一颗不堪餐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39572,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杏花","author":"徐渭","text":"道人懒为著色物，偶施小茜作嬉游。\n人言杏花可摘卖，挂向街头试买不。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39573,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪粉团","author":"徐渭","text":"北斗垂天锦帐横，景阳催妾未鸡鸣。\n灯昏镜暗妆无准，糁粉过眉与鼻平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39574,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画石榴","author":"徐渭","text":"五寸珊瑚珠一囊，秋风吹老海榴黄。\n宵来酒渴真无奈，唤取金刀劈玉浆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39575,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"榴","author":"徐渭","text":"略著腂脂染一堆，蛟潭锦蚌挂人眉。\n山深秋老无人摘，自迸明珠打雀儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39576,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉簪花","author":"徐渭","text":"老人一扫秋园卉，六片尖尖雪色流。\n用尽邢州砂万斛，未便琢出此搔头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39577,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芭蕉","author":"徐渭","text":"红棘黄荆樵斧归，芭蕉学画指如椎。\n中间一叶浑相识，记得前生盖鹿来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39578,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沈君索题所画卉贺人新婚","author":"徐渭","text":"莲花如妾叶如郎，画得花长叶亦长。\n若使画莲能并蒂，不须重画两鸳鸯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39579,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄蔷薇","author":"徐渭","text":"蔷薇黄似月初华，难写芳香只写花。\n若使移生南海国，取将露水粉宫娃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39580,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"木笔花","author":"徐渭","text":"束如笔颖放如莲，画笔临时两斗妍。\n料得将开园内日，霞笺雨墨写青天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39581,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茉莉花","author":"徐渭","text":"南海曾经驻客骖，芳称茉莉荔称甘。\n如今画里看花色，记得依稀似海南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39582,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画海棠","author":"徐渭","text":"海棠弄春垂紫丝，一枝立鸟压花低。\n去年二月如曾见，却是谁家湖石西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39583,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画玫瑰花","author":"徐渭","text":"画里看花不下楼，甜香巳觉入清喉。\n无因摘向金陵去，短撅长丁送茗瓯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39584,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青门山人画滇茶花","author":"徐渭","text":"武林画史沈青门，把兔申藤善写生。\n何事胭脂鲜若此，一天露水带昆明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39585,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松竹梅","author":"徐渭","text":"朱碧娇啼二月莺，却都输与此三君。\n若添明月孤来鹤，踏乱松尖一片云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39586,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"作荷芦于是日亦次朝题","author":"徐渭","text":"芦上荷花高一寻，芦中夏色冻阴阴。\n兴虽有馀笔秃尽，难画鸬鹚照浅深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39587,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芭蕉墨牡丹","author":"徐渭","text":"知道行家学不来，烂涂蕉叶倒莓苔。\n冯伊遮盖无盐墨，免作胭脂抹瘿腮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39588,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芭蕉玉簪","author":"徐渭","text":"烂醉中秋睡起迟，苍蝇留墨研头池。\n合欢翠扇遮羞面，白玉搔头去嫁谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39589,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芭蕉鸡冠","author":"徐渭","text":"芭蕉叶下鸡冠花，一朵红鲜不可遮。\n老夫烂醉抺此幅，雨后西天忽晚霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39590,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅桂谖草","author":"徐渭","text":"金陵梅桂饀酥蒸，北地黄花掺肉羹。\n一吸葡萄春五斗，旋移狂墨写刘伶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39591,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枯木石竹","author":"徐渭","text":"道人写竹并枯丛，却与禅家气味同。\n大抵绝无花叶相，一团苍老墓烟中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39592,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其一 白头翁桃花","author":"徐渭","text":"白头翁亦恋花枝，飞上桃花影自窥。\n若使逢花不能赏，也应花鸟笑人痴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39593,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其二","author":"徐渭","text":"雷雨垂垂翠色繁，古松阴里了歌喧。\n问渠何事为人语，我爱山中听鸟言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39594,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其三","author":"徐渭","text":"金缕围睛可一针，端州石子尔为珍。\n夜来迸破封函土，飞入谁家苦竹林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39595,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画 其四","author":"徐渭","text":"冻合梅花瞑色多，双鸠鸣唤坐交柯。\n雀心愁雪正欲绝，呼雨呼睛奈尔何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39596,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"独喜萱花到白头图","author":"徐渭","text":"问之花鸟何为者，独喜萱花到白头。\n莫把月青等閒看，无声诗里颂千秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39597,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题花图","author":"徐渭","text":"金谷园中花草新，太湖石畔斗芳春。\n红颜笑脸如撩客，粉面藏头羞见人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39598,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书花册送王生","author":"徐渭","text":"送客之燕上马时，图花满册各成诗。\n河桥杨柳如教见，应喜相饶赠别枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39599,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏画降龙","author":"徐渭","text":"乾坤纸上黑腾腾，爪股风雷墨所生。\n一雨尽归烧尾德，世间谁识有曹兴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":39600,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]